<mxfile><diagram name="extraction"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="520" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="1100" pageHeight="520" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="Extracting a batch of files" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=26;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1020" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="A hundred files at a time. The adapter reads them into rows in Python; the rules, polars over every row of the batch at once, make each file&#x27;s chunks; staging gives them ids and tokens." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#8e908c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="1020" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="build" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#4d4d4c;&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:7px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4d4d4c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;build.py&lt;br&gt;lists each file: stored,&lt;br&gt;or to extract&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4d4d4c;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="130" width="220" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="read" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#4d4d4c;&quot;&gt;Adapter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:7px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4d4d4c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;treesitter.read&lt;br&gt;each file, then each block it hands on: the query or the chunker&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ede6f2;strokeColor=#8959a8;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="130" width="260" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#4d4d4c;&quot;&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:7px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4d4d4c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;rbtr.domain.rules&lt;br&gt;capture_chunks · line_windows&lt;br&gt;assemble&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3eaf3;strokeColor=#4271ae;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="130" width="220" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stage" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#4d4d4c;&quot;&gt;Staging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:7px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4d4d4c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;staging.py&lt;br&gt;staged_chunks: ids, search tokens, serials&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4d4d4c;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="330" width="220" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="write" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#4d4d4c;&quot;&gt;WriteSession&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:7px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4d4d4c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;writer.py&lt;br&gt;replace_chunks: each blob&#x27;s old chunks out, the batch in&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4d4d4c;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="330" width="260" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#4d4d4c;&quot;&gt;Where the loops are&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:7px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4d4d4c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;Over files, parses, matches and nodes, in the adapter: tree-sitter&#x27;s objects and the plugins&#x27; functions are Python. After it, every step is a set operation over the batch.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4d4d4c;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4d4d4c;fontFamily=Jost;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DJost%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C100..900%3B1%2C100..900%26display%3Dswap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="220" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="